# Generated class material. This is a symlink into the course folder on Google
# Drive, so curate writes straight there and the shortlists never enter this
# (public) repo. NO trailing slash: git treats a symlink as a file, so
# "shortlists/" would fail to match it and commit the absolute path.
shortlists
